---
import BaseLayoutV2 from '../layouts/BaseLayoutV2.astro';
import EmailCaptureForm from '../components/EmailCaptureForm';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';

const stages = [
  ['01', 'Frame', 'Turn the situation into a decision you can actually work on.'],
  ['02', 'Inspect', 'Surface the evidence, assumptions and constraints already in play.'],
  ['03', 'Test', 'Interrogate weak logic and ask the next useful question.'],
  ['04', 'Compare', 'Make the real trade-offs between credible options visible.'],
  ['05', 'Decide', 'Form a recommendation with calibrated confidence.'],
  ['06', 'Execute', 'Set the risks, owners and review points that keep it honest.'],
];
---

<BaseLayoutV2
  title="GreenSquare Free | GreenSquare AI"
  description="A free, adaptive decision system that helps you frame, challenge and act on consequential decisions."
>
  <div>
    <section class="v-section v-cream hero">
      <div class="v-container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="v-eyebrow">GreenSquare Free</p>
          <h1>Give it the problem.<br />It works out what to ask next.</h1>
          <p class="v-lede">A guided decision system that adapts to your situation, challenges the logic and produces a portable Decision Brief.</p>
          <div class="v-actions">
            <a class="v-btn v-btn-primary" href="#get-free">Get GreenSquare Free</a>
            <a class="v-link" href={withBase('/product/#demo')}>See how it works</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="brief-card" aria-label="Illustrative GreenSquare Decision Brief">
          <div class="brief-top"><span>DECISION BRIEF</span><span>01 / 06</span></div>
          <p class="v-small">DECISION</p>
          <h2>Where should we focus the next quarter?</h2>
          <div class="brief-row"><span>Current confidence</span><strong>MEDIUM</strong></div>
          <div class="brief-row"><span>Next question</span><strong>Demand evidence</strong></div>
          <div class="brief-footer">Portable file · Your evidence · Your judgement</div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="v-section v-white">
      <div class="v-container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="v-eyebrow">An adaptive interview</p>
          <h2>It changes course when the decision changes.</h2>
          <p>GreenSquare does not push every problem through a fixed questionnaire. Each answer updates the state of the decision and determines what needs attention next.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stages">
          {stages.map(([number, name, copy]) => (
            <article>
              <span>{number}</span>
              <h3>{name}</h3>
              <p>{copy}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="v-section v-black">
      <div class="v-container boundary-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="v-eyebrow">The operating boundary</p>
          <h2>GreenSquare strengthens judgement. It does not replace it.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="boundary-list">
          <p><strong>Your environment.</strong> Use it with a capable AI model you already trust.</p>
          <p><strong>Your evidence.</strong> Bring the facts, constraints and context that matter.</p>
          <p><strong>Your accountability.</strong> You remain responsible for the decision and its consequences.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="v-section v-green" id="get-free">
      <div class="v-container signup-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="v-eyebrow">Free during beta</p>
          <h2>Start with a real decision.</h2>
          <p>Join the beta list and we’ll email you GreenSquare Free.</p>
        </div>
        <EmailCaptureForm client:load />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="v-section v-cream">
      <div class="v-container faq-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="v-eyebrow">Questions</p>
          <h2>What GreenSquare Free is, and is not.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details open>
            <summary>Is this a worksheet?</summary>
            <p>No. It is an adaptive decision process. The path changes based on what your decision needs.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Does it make the decision for me?</summary>
            <p>No. It interrogates the problem, makes trade-offs visible and helps you form a defensible recommendation. Accountability stays with you.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Which AI model does it use?</summary>
            <p>GreenSquare Free is designed to work with a capable model in the environment you choose. It is not tied to one provider.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What is GreenSquare Pro?</summary>
            <p>The paid plan is in development. We will announce its scope only when the product boundary is ready.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayoutV2>

<style>
  .hero { padding-top: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
  .hero-grid, .boundary-grid, .signup-grid, .faq-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.12fr) minmax(18rem,.88fr); gap:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,7rem); align-items:center; }
  h1 { max-width:12ch; }
  .v-lede { max-width:38rem; }
  .brief-card { background:var(--v-black); color:var(--v-cream); padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.5rem); transform:rotate(1.25deg); box-shadow:1.1rem 1.1rem 0 var(--v-green); }
  .brief-top, .brief-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; }
  .brief-top { border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); padding-bottom:1rem; margin-bottom:2.5rem; font:700 .72rem/1 var(--v-font-mono); letter-spacing:.08em; }
  .brief-card .v-small { color:var(--v-lime); }
  .brief-card h2 { font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.6rem); margin-bottom:3rem; }
  .brief-row { border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); padding:1rem 0; font-size:.9rem; }
  .brief-row strong { color:var(--v-lime); font-family:var(--v-font-mono); font-size:.72rem; }
  .brief-footer { margin-top:2rem; color:var(--v-cream-soft); font-size:.76rem; }
  .section-head { max-width:48rem; margin-bottom:3rem; }
  .stages { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); border-top:1px solid var(--v-line); border-left:1px solid var(--v-line); }
  .stages article { min-height:15rem; padding:1.5rem; border-right:1px solid var(--v-line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--v-line); }
  .stages span { color:var(--v-green-deep); font:700 .75rem/1 var(--v-font-mono); }
  .stages h3 { margin-top:3.5rem; }
  .stages p { color:var(--v-ink-soft); font-size:.95rem; }
  .boundary-list p { border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); padding:1.2rem 0; margin:0; color:var(--v-cream-soft); }
  .boundary-list strong { color:var(--v-cream); }
  .signup-grid form { max-width:34rem; }
  .faq-grid { align-items:start; }
  .faq-list details { border-top:1px solid var(--v-line); padding:1.25rem 0; }
  .faq-list summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:700; }
  .faq-list p { color:var(--v-ink-soft); margin:1rem 0 0; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero-grid, .boundary-grid, .signup-grid, .faq-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .brief-card { transform:none; box-shadow:.65rem .65rem 0 var(--v-green); }
    .stages { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .stages article { min-height:auto; }
    .stages h3 { margin-top:2rem; }
  }
</style>
